        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG245-630, Modern Interior European Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI SIG245-630 comes packaged with just the plates and the installation hardware. It is made out of solid stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG245-dimentions.gif?v=1704442281\" width=\"377\" height=\"306\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG245-630 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern European Plates:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  50mm</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length From Top of Plate to Center of Lever Cut-Out: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Trim is on one side of door. Comes packaged with 1 trim plate only.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Comes packaged with exterior and interior trim plates,.</li></ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. AHI backplates only, no levers and only installation screws included. </i>\r\n</p>",
